<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia budget proposes multimedia incentives.</title>
<headline>Malaysia budget proposes multimedia incentives.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Information technology firms locating in Malaysia's newly-launched &quot;multi-media super corridor&quot; will be given major tax breaks in the 1997 budget unveiled in parliament on Friday.</p>
</text>
